  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0">Declare rigor FULL. Verify task 138 has merged: its write-time check and modal states are present. Re-read DelegationRuleFilter, RecordShareLevels, InternalShareEndpoints.ShareAsync and CreateGrantAsync as they stand.</step>
    <step order="1">RecordShareLevels:
- Add Share to the Collaborate and Full masks and to the pairing table.
- Accept the legacy masks in LevelForMask.
- Rewrite the remarks to the 2026-09-30 rule, keeping the vocabulary and nesting warnings.</step>
    <step order="2">ProvisionProjectEndpoint: make creator and colleague rights identical (the new Collaborate level). Rewrite the :158-181 remarks.</step>
    <step order="3">Add the ceiling method to ExternalAccessLevels. In /grant and /invite-and-grant, after task 138's policy check and before any write or onboarding:
- re-probe the caller's rights;
- compute the ceiling;
- narrow;
- apply the never-silently-lower refusal against the existing active row;
- apply the deny-list refusal through the shared deny entry point.
Return the additive response fields.</step>
