- enumerate principalobjectaccess rows on sprk_project, sprk_matter and sprk_workassignment whose principal is a systemuser and whose mask is exactly 23 or 65559 (list team-principal rows at those masks separately, untouched);
- ModifyAccess each to 262167 or 327703;
- report counts; leave every other mask untouched and list it.
Run -DryRun only and record the output.</step>
    <step order="7">Rewrite the superseded tests, notes and docs listed in the background. Add the new cap, narrow, lower-refusal and deny tests, each with a positive twin. Perturbation-check: remove the ceiling, remove Share from the pairing table, and remove the lower-refusal; record which tests go red for each.</step>
    <step order="8">Build, unit + integration + arch suites, jest, PCF build:prod. Measure publish size (§10). Run the CVE scan.</step>
